From: xiaobao <xiaobao@local>
Subject: [PATCH] es8323: make OUT1/OUT2 output path always-connected (break DAPM deadlock)

On the Neardi LZ200 (RK3576) board the es8323 codec's "OUT1"/"OUT2" widgets
are SND_SOC_DAPM_SWITCH with a virtual (SND_SOC_NOPM) "Switch" kcontrol that
defaults OFF. This disconnects the Mixer -> LOUT1/ROUT1 -> Headphone path,
so DAPM never powers the upstream DAC/Out PGAs during playback -> DACPOWER
stuck at 0xc0 -> no analog output on the 3.5mm jack.

Because the switch is virtual and defaults off, DAPM cannot reach a complete
active path, so the DAC is never powered and the switch can never be turned
on -> deadlock. Fix by making OUT1/OUT2 always-connected PGAs (no gate), so
the playback path is complete and DAPM powers DAC + OUT1/OUT2 during playback.

The two SOC_DAPM_SINGLE kcontrols (es8323_out1_switch / es8323_out2_switch)
become unreferenced with this change, so drop them to avoid
-Wunused-const-variable warnings.

This pairs with 0007 (es8323 DAC widget stream name -> "Playback").

Note: regenerated against linux-rockchip rk-6.1-rkr7.2 (commit 85233a85) --
the previous hand-written version had malformed hunk headers (declared 8/15
lines where the hunks actually had 7/12) and bare blank context lines, so
`patch` rejected it with "malformed patch at line 35".

---
 sound/soc/codecs/es8323.c | 18 ++++++------------
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

diff --git a/sound/soc/codecs/es8323.c b/sound/soc/codecs/es8323.c
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/es8323.c
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/es8323.c
@@ -237,12 +237,6 @@
 	SOC_DAPM_SINGLE("Right Bypass Switch", ES8323_DACCONTROL20, 6, 1, 0),
 };
 
-static const struct snd_kcontrol_new es8323_out1_switch =
-	SOC_DAPM_SINGLE("Switch", SND_SOC_NOPM, 0, 1, 0);
-
-static const struct snd_kcontrol_new es8323_out2_switch =
-	SOC_DAPM_SINGLE("Switch", SND_SOC_NOPM, 0, 1, 0);
-
 static const struct snd_soc_dapm_widget es8323_dapm_widgets[] = {
 	SND_SOC_DAPM_INPUT("LINPUT1"),
 	SND_SOC_DAPM_INPUT("LINPUT2"),
@@ -292,8 +286,8 @@
 	SND_SOC_DAPM_PGA("LAMP", ES8323_ADCCONTROL1, 4, 0, NULL, 0),
 	SND_SOC_DAPM_PGA("RAMP", ES8323_ADCCONTROL1, 0, 0, NULL, 0),
 
-	SND_SOC_DAPM_SWITCH("OUT1", SND_SOC_NOPM, 0, 0, &es8323_out1_switch),
-	SND_SOC_DAPM_SWITCH("OUT2", SND_SOC_NOPM, 0, 0, &es8323_out2_switch),
+	SND_SOC_DAPM_PGA("OUT1", SND_SOC_NOPM, 0, 0, NULL, 0),
+	SND_SOC_DAPM_PGA("OUT2", SND_SOC_NOPM, 0, 0, NULL, 0),
 	SND_SOC_DAPM_OUTPUT("LOUT1"),
 	SND_SOC_DAPM_OUTPUT("ROUT1"),
 	SND_SOC_DAPM_OUTPUT("LOUT2"),
@@ -349,19 +343,19 @@
 	{"Right Mixer", "Right Bypass Switch", "Right Line Mux"},
 
 	{"Left Out 1", NULL, "Left Mixer"},
-	{"OUT1", "Switch", "Left Out 1"},
+	{"OUT1", NULL, "Left Out 1"},
 	{"LOUT1", NULL, "OUT1"},
 
 	{"Right Out 1", NULL, "Right Mixer"},
-	{"OUT1", "Switch", "Right Out 1"},
+	{"OUT1", NULL, "Right Out 1"},
 	{"ROUT1", NULL, "OUT1"},
 
 	{"Left Out 2", NULL, "Left Mixer"},
-	{"OUT2", "Switch", "Left Out 2"},
+	{"OUT2", NULL, "Left Out 2"},
 	{"LOUT2", NULL, "OUT2"},
 
 	{"Right Out 2", NULL, "Right Mixer"},
-	{"OUT2", "Switch", "Right Out 2"},
+	{"OUT2", NULL, "Right Out 2"},
 	{"ROUT2", NULL, "OUT2"},
 };
 
